> **Solution**: Only use solver hints from this verified list:
> 
> **Available Solver Hints**:
> - `Array.size_set` — size after set operation
> - `Array.size_swap` — size after swap
> - `Array.get_set_c` — get after set (conditional on index)
> - `Array.multiset_swap` — swap preserves permutation
> - `Array.size_replicate` — size of replicated array
> - `Nat.mod_lt` — modular arithmetic bounds
> - `Nat.sub_add_cancel` — subtraction/addition cancellation
> 
> **Do NOT guess lemma names**. Common hallucinations to avoid:
> - ❌ `Array.get_swap_c` (doesn't exist)
> - ❌ `<MethodName>_correct` (not a standard name)
> - ❌ `List.qsort` (wrong Lean 4 API)
